        <DisplayName>VI-CXL Supreme Cargo Transport</DisplayName>
        <Description>The absolute titan of the logistics division. The VI-CXL Supreme Cargo Transport was engineered to close the gap in system-wide mass shipping operations. Powered by a massive combination nuclear-and-battery grid, this colossal atmospheric hauler moves staggering resource weight through high planetary resistance without breaking protocol.</Description>
